Name: gvdb
URL: https://gitlab.gnome.org/GNOME/gvdb
Version: N/A
Revision: c6f2359cc1d00f16e0a0e2527fa0bc1882b8b5ab
Update Mechanism: Autoroll
License: LGPL-2.1
License File: src/COPYING
Shipped: no
Security Critical: no

Description:
A simple database file format that stores a mapping from strings to GVariant
values in a way that is extremely efficient for lookups.

This is only used in tests.

Upstream doesn't make releases, so this is rolled to upstream main by an
autoroller, with a cooldown. glib and mutter both build against this copy
(upstream pins a gvdb revision in their subprojects/gvdb.wrap). If a roll
breaks them, update BUILD.gn or hold the roll until glib catches up.

Local Modifications:
None.
